# 项目初始化目录清单（project_layer.manifest）
# 菜单「草木句萌/▶ 项目初始化」与 Edt_ProjectPathCheck 共用
# 每行一条 Assets 路径；有扩展名视为文件（从 ProjectSetup/Seeds 复制），否则视为目录
# 种子文件在 Seeds 中多为 *.txt 后缀（如 *.cs.txt、*.md.txt）；已存在的路径不会覆盖
# Assets/_WorkSpace 会替换为 CmgmFrameSettings.WORK_SPACE_ROOT

Assets/_TestSpace
Assets/_TestSpace/_TestSpace文件夹说明.txt
Assets/_WorkSpace
Assets/_PublicRes
Assets/_PublicRes/_PublicRes文件夹说明.txt
Assets/_WorkSpace/GAME_WORKSPACE.md
Assets/_WorkSpace/Excels
Assets/_WorkSpace/HotRes
Assets/_WorkSpace/HotRes/BuildSource/RELEASE_NOTE.txt
Assets/_WorkSpace/HotRes/Lua/main.lua.txt
Assets/_WorkSpace/HotRes/Scenes/InitScene.unity
Assets/_WorkSpace/HotRes/Scenes/MainScene.unity
Assets/_WorkSpace/HotRes/UI/Panels/MainPanel.prefab
Assets/_WorkSpace/HotRes/UI/Panels/LoadingPanel.prefab
Assets/_WorkSpace/HotRes/UI/Panels/DialogPanel.prefab
